# Isaac-GR00T-DCU 适配优化

## 概述

英伟达 **Isaac GR00T**(人形机器人基础模型,GR00T-N1)在海光 DCU 上的微调适配与优化

## 技术要点

- 模型:GR00T-N1(如 GR00T-N1.7-3B-local-cosmos)

  ```bash
  export HF_ENDPOINT=https://hf-mirror.com
  huggingface-cli download nvidia/Gr00T-N1.7-3B --local-dir /workspace/data/checkpoints/GR00T-N1.7-3B-local-cosmos
  huggingface-cli download nvidia/Cosmos-Reason2-2B --local-dir /workspace/data/checkpoints/nvidia/Cosmos-Reason2-2B
  ```

- 数据集:LIBERO 系列(libero_10_no_noops_1.0.0_lerobot_h264),embodiment-tag `LIBERO_PANDA`

  ```bash
  huggingface-cli download lerobot/libero_10_no_noops --local-dir /workspace/data/libero_10_no_noops_1.0.0_lerobot_h264
  ```

- DCU 适配:依赖替换为 DCU 生态版本;模型与训练代码修改集中在 `patches/` 文件夹
- 基础镜像:`harbor.sourcefind.cn:5443/dcu/admin/base/pytorch:2.9.0-ubuntu22.04-dtk26.04-py3.10`
- 启动命令:

  ```bash
  #!/bin/bash
  set -x -euo pipefail

  source /zhangyifan/groot/torchcodec-env/bin/activate
  export PYTHONPATH=/zhangyifan/groot/Isaac-GR00T:${PYTHONPATH:-}
  cd /zhangyifan/groot/Isaac-GR00T
  export HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7
  export USE_COMPILE="${USE_COMPILE:-1}"
  export ROCBLAS_TENSILE_GEMM_OVERRIDE_PATH=/zhangyifan/groot/tuned_gemm.log
  NUM_GPUS=8 MASTER_PORT="${MASTER_PORT:-29506}" MAX_STEPS=500 USE_WANDB=0 \
  DATALOADER_NUM_WORKERS=16 GLOBAL_BATCH_SIZE=960 \
  EXPERIMENT_NAME=0731 HF_TOKEN=${HF_TOKEN} \
  bash examples/finetune.sh \
    --base-model-path /zhangyifan/groot/checkpoints/GR00T-N1.7-3B-local-cosmos \
    --dataset-path /zhangyifan/groot/libero_10_no_noops_1.0.0_lerobot_h264 \
    --embodiment-tag LIBERO_PANDA \
    --output-dir /zhangyifan/groot/outputs
  ```

## 优化记录

1. 优化器更换:AdamW 替换为 AdamW_fused
2. Action_head 进行局部融合

   ```python
   model.action_head = torch.compile(model.action_head)
   ```

3. Gemm 调优:如遇 GBS 调整带来的性能劣化,可从 trace 文件中观察到矩阵乘耗时占比增加,可用 DTK 自带的 `/opt/dtk/lib/rocblas/rocblas-gemm-tune` 调优